<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms buy 35,000 T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms buy 35,000 T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms bought 35,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for February shipment, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>One trader involved in the deal said the firms bought 29,000 tonnes dark northern spring wheat at $3.94 per bushel FOB from a U.S. port and 6,000 tonnes of western white wheat at $3.90 per bushel.</p>
<p>&quot;The transaction was made late last week,&quot; the trader who did not want to be identified said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
